# The image is built from app/, the entrypoint and the two design documents;
# nothing else is context.
*
!app
!docker-entrypoint.sh
!ARCHITECTURE.md
!BUILDS.md

# A checkout that also runs the dev server holds its install, its store and a
# previous build under app/. The image makes its own.
app/node_modules
app/.pnpm-store
app/.corepack
app/.vite
app/.tanstack
app/.output
app/dist
app/src/routeTree.gen.ts
